    "title": "Public comment period open for Johnson County bridge rehabilitation projects - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Colin Schowe ,\n1 days ago WARRENSBURG, Mo - The Missouri Department of Transportation has opened a public comment period for planned bridge rehabilitation projects on U.S. Route 50 in Johnson County. The bridges are located on westbound 50 at Post Oak Creek and Devils Branch just west of Warrensburg. The public comment period runs until... Read full article",
